                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "9 hours into this as of this review. I just can't take anymore of this, it is really bad.\nI feel like this uses completely outdated VN practices. You get reeled in by something interesting (the shinigami) and then you get pounded with hours and hours of slice of life scenes that don't add anything. Nowadays VNs actually try to make the slice of life enjoyable, and add immersion. While also in irotoridori sekai, there was a common route story involving the other world. This has absolutely nothing. It's just painfully padded slice of life, talking about stars but rarely doing anything about it. It's all so outdated and the heroines talk to the protagonist like he is a 5 year old child, which is very frustrating to go through. I suggest to only read this if you have nothing else and just want to experience an early work by FAVORITE.",
